          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Treadmill decline is for training the way down.</strong> It
            prepares the thighs for the braking work of downhill running and walking, which makes it
